<title>EGYPT: Egypt pound overnight, one-week rates up.</title>
<headline>Egypt pound overnight, one-week rates up.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight interbank rates on the Egyptian pound rose on Sunday in a short market to a range of 10 and 10-1/4 percent from Thursday's range of 9-3/4 and 10 percent, private sector bankers said.</p>
<p>One week rates also rose to between 10 and 10-3/8 percent from 9-3/4 and 10-1/8 percent on Thursday, they added.</p>
<p>Public sector banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rates at 10-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.395 pounds)</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
